= check-blind-to-an-unaddressable-session
f libexec/mux-check
t mux-check
# THE GAP THE REFUSALS LEAVE: a session made with RAW tmux, which only became
# possible at all in tmux 3.7 (it sanitises session names NOT AT ALL, where
# 3.4 and 3.6 fold a colon). Nothing else in the audit can see it, and the
# session works perfectly while being impossible to name in an address, so
# this is the marker contract's "fully installed and fully broken" shape
# narrowed to one name.
-     mux_sess_name_clean "$_s" || _unaddr="$_unaddr[$_s] "
+     :
