# ONE ANSWER FOR "WHICH PARTITION AM I IN", after seven hand-written copies.
# The early return is what preserves their `&&`: an UNRESOLVABLE context must
# answer EMPTY, so each caller decides what that costs it (agent scopes to
# global, resume refuses). Printing unconditionally hands every one of them
# `global` instead, which for an actuating verb is failing OPEN.
