+ PROBE=$(_hook "$(_seam "${MUX_LATCH_PROBE:-}" latch-probe '')")
m ran no ssh-probe

# AND ITS OFF SWITCH, which the default made necessary. An EMPTY config value
# reads as absent in `_seam` and falls through to the default, and a value
# `_hook` cannot resolve exits 2 by design, so without this word there is no
# spelling for "I do not want one" and a user cannot undo a default.
