# AN INERT CONFIG DIRECTIVE. Measured before the marker existed: three
# mistyped keys and the audit said `[OK] config overlay` about all of them. It
# matters more now a provisioner may PLACE this file, because a placed file is
# re-asserted every run and nobody reads it again, so a key renamed in a later
# mux does nothing for as long as the box lives.
